(payment of interest on a demand note, without any agreement in writing) Tj T*
(extending the note. The payment, however, of interest in advance,) Tj T*
(after maturity of a promissory note, evidenced by an indorsement,) Tj T*
(constitutes a taxable renewal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Liability to tax and the amount thereof, is determined by the form) Tj T*
(and face of a check or draft and cannot be affected by proof of facts) Tj T*
(or instructions outside of the instrument. Payment for the stamp is a) Tj T*
(matter for adjustment between the parties, but obligation rests upon) Tj T*
(the drawee, payee, or indorsee of a draft to see that the tax is paid) Tj T*
(before or at the time of acceptance or delivery and both parties to a) Tj T*
(promissory note are responsible for affixing and cancelling stamps in) Tj T*
(the required amount.) Tj T*
