() Tj T*
(The following instruments payable otherwise than at sight or on demand) Tj T*
(are included among taxable drafts and checks:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    1. Trade and bankers? acceptances.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    2. Post-dated checks expressly payable after their date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    3. Time drafts drawn against the proceeds of drafts exempt) Tj T*
(    under \(4\) below.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    4. Drafts stating no time for payment which are accepted for) Tj T*
(    payment at a certain future date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    5. Time drafts drawn on a domestic bank for the purpose of) Tj T*
(    securing money to purchase goods to be exported.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    6. Time drafts, not covering exports, drawn and delivered or) Tj T*
(    accepted in the United States and payable in foreign countries.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    7. Time drafts covering articles shipped from the United) Tj T*
(    States, Hawaii and Alaska to the Canal Zone, if such drafts are) Tj T*
(    delivered within the United States, Hawaii or Alaska.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    8. Time drafts drawn against shipments from the Virgin Islands,) Tj T*
(    the Philippines and Porto Rico into the United States, if) Tj T*
(    delivery or acceptance of such drafts first takes place within) Tj T*
(    the United States, Alaska or Hawaii.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
